# Business Rules

## Transaction

- Every Transaction belongs to exactly one Household.
- Every Transaction has a type: "income", "expense", or "transfer".
- Income and expense Transactions belong to exactly one Account and exactly one Category.
- Transfer Transactions link exactly two Accounts (from → to) and have no Category.

---

## Income & Expense

- **amount is signed:** positive for income, negative for expense. The sign must agree with `type`.
- **Category type must match transaction type:** income transactions require an income category, expense transactions require an expense category.

---

## Transfer

- A Transfer moves money from one Account (`from`) to another Account (`to`).
- **amount is the transfer magnitude:** always positive.
- `from` and `to` must be different Accounts.
- On create: `from.balance -= amount`, `to.balance += amount`.
- Transfers do not affect income/expense totals and do not change Household net.

---

## Balance Auto-Update

- When a Transaction is created: Account balance(s) are updated.
- When a Transaction is updated: Account balance(s) are reversed (old values) then applied (new values).
- When a Transaction is deleted: Account balance(s) are reversed (old values).

---

## Metadata

- Every Transaction records `createdBy` (who created it) and `updatedBy` (who last updated it).
- These are metadata only — no audit trail of previous values.

---

## Visibility

- Transactions on visible Accounts: fully visible and editable by Members.
- Transactions on hidden Accounts: visible and editable by Members for existing transactions only. Member cannot create new transactions on hidden accounts or reassign existing transactions to hidden accounts.
- Transfers: a Member must have both Accounts visible to create or reassign a Transfer. A Transfer touching a hidden Account remains visible and editable by Members for existing transfers only.
- Transactions on visible Categories: fully visible and editable by Members.
- Transactions on hidden Categories: completely invisible and untouchable by Members. Transfers have no Category and are not affected by category visibility.

